{"name":"Corsa Rossa","hex":"#f5222b","fetched":"2026-10-24","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Opel Corsa","blocks":[{"text":"The Opel Corsa is a supermini car manufactured and marketed by Opel since 1982. The car is known as the Vauxhall Corsa in the United Kingdom. Before General Motors sold Opel and Vauxhall to PSA Group in 2017, the Corsa was also rebadged under the Chevrolet, Holden and Buick brands."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg/330px-Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Opel_Corsa","wikidata":"Q376916"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg/500px-Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg/1280px-Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg/500px-Opel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOpel_Corsa-e_at_IAA_2019_IMG_0738.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Opel_Corsa_A_front_20080131.jpg/500px-Opel_Corsa_A_front_20080131.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Opel_Corsa_A_front_20080131.jpg/1280px-Opel_Corsa_A_front_20080131.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Opel_Corsa_A_front_20080131.jpg/500px-Opel_Corsa